{
  "_readme": [
    "Which Diamond functions a person signs in a wallet, and so need a clear-signing display (#3348, #3718 step 1).",
    "Every non-view function of every facet in scripts/diamond-facets.json must be named here with its class. scripts/build-clear-signing.mjs refuses an unnamed one, so a new function cannot ship without a decision. There are no facet-wide defaults: one hid two user calls in an admin facet while this file was first written.",
    "Classes: user = a person signs it from their own wallet (it gets a display in clear-signing/display.mjs); upkeep = a keeper, solver or anyone runs it for the protocol, not for the signer's own position; admin = a role holder or the owner; internal = only the Diamond itself, a vault or another platform contract can call it.",
    "A function the permissionless-steps ledger calls a user step must be user here, and a keeper or alternative step must be upkeep or user; the generator checks both."
  ],
